Value Filldown slot (\d+)
Value Required fan (\d+)
Value fan_status (\S+)
Value fan_airflow_direction (\S+)
Value preferred_fan_airflow_direction (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*(?:Slot \d+:|Fan \d+|__NETOPS_TEXTFSM_END_OF_INPUT_7F3A9C__) -> Continue.Record
  ^\s*Slot ${slot}:
  ^\s*Fan ${fan} State:\s*${fan_status}
  ^\s*Fan ${fan}:
  ^\s*State\s*:\s*${fan_status}
  ^\s*Airflow Direction:\s*${fan_airflow_direction}
  ^\s*Prefer Airflow Direction:\s*${preferred_fan_airflow_direction}
  ^\s*${fan}\s+${fan_status}\s+\d+\s*$$ -> Record

EOF
